## What Problem This Solves

Adds the bundled ElevenLabs plugin's optional `elevenlabs_dialogue` tool for ordered short scripts using exactly two voices.

Closes #187817

## Why This Change Was Made

The tool reuses the existing ElevenLabs TTS/Talk configuration resolver, sends one bounded Eleven v3 request through the guarded provider path, then returns saved audio through OpenClaw's media and current-source reply contracts. The bounded optional capability is approved for maintenance within the existing bundled ElevenLabs plugin.

## User Impact

Operators can request one dialogue MP3 from an ordered A/B/A script without stitching separate single-voice responses.

