- Fresh after Gateway-owner extraction: actual Gateway delegation, two configured channels, canonical sender with a declining action handler, unsupported/disabled zero-effect controls, and private WebChat. The model-delegated Gateway action runs in process; fixture ingress and the disabled-account RPC use real loopback WebSockets. These synthetic transports do not claim a live external-platform test.
